    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mu tshidimu tshia kumudilu tshia bukokeshi bua Dayawesha, muana wa Ahashawelosha, wa tshisamba tshia Bena Madai, wakalelabo mukelenge ku mutu kua bukelenge bua Bena Kasada; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "mu tshidimu tshia kumudilu tshia bukokeshi buandi, meme Danyele, nakatangila mu Mifundu ya Nzambi ne bidimu makumi muanda mutekete nebihite diambedi dibutuka dia Yelushalema kadiyi dianze kushika bu bungi bua bidimu biakambila Yehowa Yelemiya muprofete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakatangisha mpala wanyi kudi Mukelenge Nzambi bua kumukeba mu kulomba ne kutendekena, mu kujila kua bia kudia, mu kuluata kua bilulu bikayabala ne mu kulaba kua butue. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nakatendelela Yehowa Nzambi wanyi, nakalonda mibi yanyi kudiye, nakamba ne, Mukelenge, Nzambi mimene udi ukuatshisha bantu buowa, udi ulonda tshihungidi tshiandi ne udi ulesha luse lujalame kudi bantu badi bamunanga ne badi batumikila mikenji yandi; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "tuakuenza malu mabi, tuakuhambuka mu nshila wa buakane, tuakuenza bibi, tuakutomboka, tuakusesuka ku mikenji yebe ne mei ebe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katuakunvuila bantu bebe, baprofete, bakuamba mei mu dina diebe kudi bakelenge betu, bakokeshi betu, batatu etu ne kudi bantu bonso ba mu buloba buetu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge wetu, buakane budi kudi, kadi tuetu tudi ne bundu ku mesu, bu mudibu lelu eu, kudi bantu ba mu Yuda ne kudi badi bashikame mu Yelushalema, kudi Bena Isalele bonso, kudi badi ha buihi ne kudi badi kule, mu maloba onso awakubatuma, bualu bua kutomboka kuabo kuakukutombokelabo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge, ku mesu kuetu kudi anu bundu, kudi bakelenge betu, kudi bakokeshi betu ne kudi batatuʼetu, bualu bua tuakukuenzela bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kudi Mukelenge Nzambi wetu kudi luse ne kujimisha kua mibi yetu, bualu bua tuakumutombokela. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katuakutumikila dî dia Yehowa Nzambi wetu, bua kulonda mikenji yandi yakatekeye ku mpala kuetu mu mei akamba bantu bandi baprofete. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bulelela, bonso ba mu Isalele bakushiha mikenji yebe, bakusesuka, kabakunvua dî diebe. Nunku bakutuha mulau bu muakuamba mutshihu udi mufunda mu mikenji ya Mose, muntu wa Nzambi, bualu bua tuakuenzela Nzambi bibi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakujadika mei andi akutuhisheye nʼau, ne akuhisheye nʼau bakokeshi betu bakadi batukokesha hakututumineye dikenga dikole. Kabena banze kuenza muanda muinshi mua diulu dionso bu muanda eu wakuenzelabo Yelushalema. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Dikenga edi diakutukuata, bu muakafundabo mu mikenji ya Mose; katuena banze kulomba luse kudi Yehowa Nzambi wetu; katuena banze kulekela malu mabi etu ne katuakutumikila mei ebe a bushuwa. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua malu â Yehowa wakalongolola dikenga edi, wakadituma kutudi: bualu bua Yehowa Nzambi wetu udi muakane mu bienzedi biandi bionso, tuetu katuakutumikila dî diandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Katataka, Mukelenge Nzambi wetu, wakuluhula bantu bebe mu buloba bua Ejipitu ku tshianza tshikole, wakunvuisha dina diebe dinene bu mudidi lelu eu, tuakuenza bibi, tuakuenza malu mabi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge, bu mudi bienzedi biebe bionso biakane udi nkusengelela ne, Tshifikʼa munda tshiebe ne tshiji tshiebe tshikole biumuke ku musoko webe Yelushalema, mukuna webe wa tshijila. Bualu bua mitu yetu ne bua malu mabi a batatuʼetu, Yelushalema ne bantu bebe biakulua tshihendu kudi bantu bonso badi batunyunguluke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bua muanda eu, Nzambi wetu, unvua kulomba kua muntu webe ne misengelelu yandi, ne bua bualu buebe mpala webe atemene tshitendelelu tshiebe tshidi tshinyanguke. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nzambi wanyi, uteleje matshu ebe, unvue. Ubulule mesu ebe, umone dibutuka dietu ne dia musoko udi muinyika dina diebe. Bualu bua katuena tukutendekena bua tudi ne bienzedi biakane, kadi anu bualu bua luse luebe lunene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Mukelenge, unvue biebe; Mukelenge, unjimishile mibi yetu; Mukelenge, utunvuile, wenze bualu ebu; kujanguluki bua muanda webe, Nzambi wanyi, bualu bua musoko webe ne bantu bebe bidi bidikibua dina diebe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hanakadi ngakula, ndomba Nzambi, ntonda bubi buanyi ne mibi ya bana betu Bena Isalele, hanakadi ntendekena ku mpala kua Yehowa Nzambi wanyi bualu bua mukuna wa tshijila wa Nzambi wanyi, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bulelela, hanakatshidi utendelela, muntu eu Gabaliele, unakumona ku tshikena kumona tshia diambedi, wakalua kundi lukasa diba dia kufila mulambu wa dilolo. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakalua kundi, wakangambila ne, Danyele, nakulua mpindiu bua kukuha lungenyi lua kujingulula n alu malu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku tshibangidilu tshia kutendekena kuebe, dî diakafuma kudi Nzambi; nakulua bua: kunuambiladi, bualu bua wewe udi munangibue bikole. Nunku teleja matshu ebe ku bualu ebu, jingulula tshikena kumona etshi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bakukosela bantu bebe ne musoko webe wa tshijila mbingu makumi muanda mutekete, bua kumana ditomboka, bua kuvuisha nshikidilu wa malu mabi, bua kulengeshisha bahambuki kudi Nzambi, bua kubavuishila buakane budi bushala tshiendelele, bua kujadika tshikena kumona ne buprofete, ne bua kujidila muaba muhite tshijila. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.24"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nunku Umanye, ujingulule ne, Diba diakahatuka mukenji ne, Bahingashe bantu mu Yelushalema ne base musoko tshiakabidi, tô ne ku difika dia muntu muedibue manyi ha mutu, mukokeshi mene, mbingu muanda mutekete neyihite. Hashishe, mu mbingu makumi asambombo ne ibidi nebase musoko tshiakabidi, muikale ne muaba munene bu wa tshisalu ne misesu; tshikondo etshi netshikale tshia ntatu mene. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashika mbingu ai makumi asambombo ne ibidi, nebashihe muntu muedibue manyi ha mutu; kakuena muntu wahiana mudimu wandi. Bantu be mukokeshi ulualua nebashihe musoko ne tshitendelelu; nshikidilu wandi neikale bu kûla ne kuhasalala kua musulu wa mai. Bakujadika ne, Dibutuka nedikaleku tô ne hashika nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.26"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DAN 9:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muntu neajadike tshihungidi tshikole ne bantu ba bungi bua kushalatshi lumingu lumue. Hankatshi ha lumingu nealekeshe difila dia mulambu wa nyama mishiha ne wa bia kudia. Mu muaba wa milambu ei yeye neateke tshinyangu tshia dibutuka, tô ne halua dibutuka diakasungula Nzambi hamʼbidi ha muena tshinyangu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DAN.9.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DAN.9.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
